[engl]
{100}{}{Garl}
{200}{}{Garl, leader of the Raiders}
{210}{}{You see before you, Garl, leader of the Raiders.}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Begin}
{1020}{}{Second time}
{2000}{}{You think you can come here without challenge?}
{2010}{}{I've come in peace to negotiate the release of Tandi.}
{2020}{}{[Leave]}
{3000}{}{I killed you!}
{3010}{}{Free the girl}
{3020}{}{Step down}
{3030}{}{Give me riches}
{3040}{}{[Leave]}
{4000}{}{What do you want?}
{4010}{}{I want to join.}
{4020}{}{[Leave]}
{4030}{}{I'm an explorer.}
{5000}{}{What makes you think I have her?}
{5010}{}{I represent a threat you don't even understand.}
{5020}{}{I will give you something of equal value.}
{5030}{}{It would be good for your eternal soul.}
{5040}{}{[Attack] Your blood, spilled on the ground.}
{6000}{}{What do you want now?}
{6010}{}{I want the girl.}
{6020}{}{Let her go, the duel is finished.}
{6030}{}{Nothing.}
{7000}{}{Why should we give one of our most prized possessions to you?}
{7010}{}{You will be allowed to live.}
{7020}{}{I have something of equal value.}
{7030}{}{It is only right.}
{8000}{}{Would you be willing to fight me over her?}
{8010}{}{Right now, just you and me.}
{8020}{}{Let's finish duel for the woman.}
{8030}{}{No.}
{8040}{}{I'll take you and your whole gang on.}
{9000}{}{Whatever for?}
{9010}{}{To kick some serious ass.}
{9020}{}{I like you guys. I want to bond with you.}
{10000}{}{I grow tired of these women. Kill them.}
{10010}{}{No!}
{10020}{}{Ok.}
{11000}{}{Ha! I like your style.}
{12000}{}{You have proved my point. Only the Raiders posses the will to survive! You do not. Kill him.}
{13000}{}{Let's get started!}
{13010}{}{I'm ready.}
{13020}{}{Give me sometime to prepare.}
{14000}{}{You won, leave with the girl.}
{14010}{}{Done.}

